# Godot 4+ specific ignores
# 只忽略缓存目录 .godot/。不要写 *.godot：那条会连工程文件 project.godot 一起忽略掉，
# 导致干净检出后工程打不开、也无法导出 PCK。
.godot/
/android/
.claude/
.trae/
.vscode/
*.md
*.import
*.uid
*.png
!SelectSpecialCardMod/images/cards/YiXiangMingTianShiZhiShengCard.png
!SelectSpecialCardMod/images/cards/YiXiangMingEMoZhiShengCard.png
*.tmp
Local.Build.props
artifacts/
Tests/**/bin/
Tests/**/obj/

!ARCHITECTURE.md
!Tests/README.md
!IMPLEMENTATION_REPORT_珠泪哀唱与驻场演出.md

Tests/GodotProbe/Scripts/

!Tests/GodotProbe/project.godot
